  message: "WORK DONE (decontend run 10032026, stage 8) on local branch jgstern-agent/fix/hilum, commits 179d46a25f (core) + 2d40bce3fa (elixir). Not pushed.\n\nEach def/defp/defmacro clause records meta[\"parameters\"] (\\\\ default marked). A bare call reaches the clauses of the FUNCTIONS (qualified name, total arity) admitting its argument count (+1 for a |> left side, +1 for a do block not absorbed by a trailing keyword list); a bodiless head's defaults lower the required count for every clause of its arity; one-arity multi-clause fan-out is kept (livebook do_transform/4 still reaches all 12 clauses, correctly). No admitting local clause -> falls through to import/Kernel/cross-file paths. unquote_splicing -> unknown count, nothing excluded.\n\nFiled instance, live repro: dev get_timeout(opts, key) calling get_timeout() emits edges to BOTH clauses (/2 self-loop + /0); branch emits only the /0 clause.\n\nMeasured by call site: livebook c39254b 109 narrowed / 5 dropped, self-call sites 287 -> 251; phoenix d4440ac 83 narrowed / 28 dropped (all read: each calls an arity no local clause has), self-call sites 118 -> 68, resolved calls edges 7967 -> 5744.\n\nTests: test_elixir_call_arity.py (8); board smart-test 13352 passed, 0 failed, 100% coverage on changed files.\nNot filed, noted: the pre-existing bare-identifier pipe branch (x |> func, no parens) still reads binary_operator children[1]/[2] by position, so a comment between pipe stages hides it; the new arity path reads the operator by field."  # eafc
